        784.7176848213114,
        14.60946442914917
      ],
      "text": "included in the tender, to be signed by the tenderer or the group leader in case of a joint ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        159.54545358722277,
        453.68473111898356,
        72.63775532255335,
        14.60946442914917
      ],
      "text": "tender). ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        489.0639841449065,
        846.6285687675777,
        14.60946442914917
      ],
      "text": "When the Declaration(s) on Honour and/or the submission report are signed by hand, a scanned copy ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        507.03360104365254,
        410.12742251852075,
        14.609464429149227
      ],
      "text": "must be attached to the tender in e-Submission. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        542.3885171367474,
        846.7216644960413,
        14.60946442914917
      ],
      "text": "After submitting a tender, but before the deadline for receipt of tenders, a tenderer may definitively ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        560.212075914863,
        846.7630728975497,
        14.609464429149227
      ],
      "text": "withdraw its tender$^{5}$, or withdraw it and replace it with a new one$^{6}$. A withdrawal receipt will be ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        578.0356103438714,
        416.23766690624086,
        14.60946442914917
      ],
      "text": "provided by e-Submission as proof of withdrawal.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        613.3905142624125,
        846.721561190258,
        14.60946442914917
      ],
      "text": "All costs incurred for the preparation and submission of tenders are to be borne by the tenderers and ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        631.2140486914207,
        194.9502394938816,
        14.609464429149227
      ],
      "text": "will not be reimbursed.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        666.5689647845154,
        15.993290020605883,
        14.609464429149227
      ],
      "text": "2.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri-Bold",
        "size": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        118.18385132056959,
        666.5689647845154,
        582.4738848438842,
        14.609464429149227
      ],
      "text": "Legal effects of the invitation to tender and submission of a tender. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri-Bold",
        "size": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        701.9603923641295,
        845.9915164366809,
        14.60946442914917
      ],
      "text": "This invitation to tender is in no way binding on the contracting authority. The contracting authority's ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        719.7839389676915,
        846.3460791029013,
        14.609464429149227
      ],
      "text": "contractual obligation commences only when the contract with the successful tenderer is signed by ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        737.6074855712534,
        112.14187311627573,
        14.60946442914917
      ],
      "text": "both parties. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        772.9623894897945,
        846.0535171243445,
        14.609464429149199
      ],
      "text": "Up to the signature of the contract the contracting authority may cancel the procurement procedure ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        790.7859360933566,
        846.7011755156692,
        14.609464429149199
      ],
      "text": "without tenderers being entitled to claim any compensation. Any such decision must be substantiated ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        808.6094705223649,
        198.5055252468332,
        14.609464429149199
      ],
      "text": "and tenderers notified. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.72726764215435,
        870.5170882154382,
        845.3167419989795,
        10.957098321861906
      ],
      "text": "$^{4}$ If no submission receipt is received in reasonable time after submission, please contact the e-Submission Helpdesk (see contact details ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        883.811700845964,
        436.43937111235346,
        10.957098321861906
      ],
      "text": "in the above referred e-Submission Quick Guide) as soon as possible. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        897.2767572281632,
        845.5439441301495,
        10.95709345204041
      ],
      "text": "$^{5}$ A submitted tender can be withdrawn directly in the \"Procurement/My Submission(s)\" area in the F&T Portal. For detailed instructions ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        910.7174608506143,
        574.90359054956,
        10.957098321861892
      ],
      "text": "on how to withdraw a tender please consult the above referred e-Submission Quick Guide. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        924.0120807858723,
        845.3061342167886,
        10.957098321861892
      ],
      "text": "$^{6}$ To submit a new version, the tenderer must create a new tender in e-Submission and include all the information and documents ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        937.452779538502,
        845.6163614843049,
        10.957098321861892
      ],
      "text": "required in the procurement documents with the submission of a tender, even if some of them have already been included in the ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        950.7473946039385,
        107.87534426232371,
        10.9570983218619
      ],
      "text": "replaced tender. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ABCDEE+Calibri",
        "size": 9
      }
